        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m trying to get confirmation of something, and this seemed a good place as Handelabra is often on the forums. I also sent a official form to them through their website.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I&#39;ve been trying to download the 1.6 update for the game, giving me access to mini-pack 2 and the Scholar. It might also help me actually find a multiplayer game on my device, which I have been unable to do.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After getting an extensive run-around from Amazon I was told the 1.6 update was incompatible with my Kindle Fire, and that I would need to purchase a Kindle Fire HD to get the most recent version of the game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This isn&#39;t a massive deal to me, my Kindle is old and the battery has been failing on me (lasts about 6 hours before needing charged), but I would like to get confirmation from Handelabra or someone who is not Amazon and has a vested interest in selling me a device before I make such a purchase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you very much for understanding.</p>",
