        "created_at": "2015-11-25T20:40:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Heya, I don't see a ticket regarding this issue - did you get an email response with a ticket number?</p><p>Amazon has recently instituted stricter rules for device support, and according to their system our game is not compatible with the Kindle Fire (2012) device, even though we know it should work. We did not know whether users were actually playing the game on that device, but now we do!</p><p>I'll get in touch with their developer support and see if there is a way to resolve this so you can get the update.</p>",
